t("Your combat focus allows you to keep your hatred burning (%0.1f hate refunded after spending hate on a talent)", "Tu enfoque de combate le permite mantener tu odio ardiendo ( %0.1f odio reembolsado después de gastar odio en un talento)", "tformat")
